    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Adopt Animal Forms to Guard the Wilds</p></blockquote><p>Druids of the Circle of the Moon draw on lunar magic to transform themselves; their order gathers under the moon to share news and perform rituals.</p><p>Changeable as the moon, such a Druid might prowl as a great cat one night, soar over the treetops as an eagle the next day, and crash through the undergrowth as a bear to drive off a trespassing monster. The wild is in their blood.</p><h3>Circle of the Moon Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.PlXdnQvVaNcwPpV8]{Circle Forms}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.5QhrRsv9HEDgRnm3]{Circle of the Moon Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.BcJA15JkWvdsY9rl]{Improved Circle Forms}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.f00nMsgQTveOG8aM]{Moonlight Step}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.xhZ7ffgVx2DGrKWK]{Lunar Form}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Circle of the Moon Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Druid Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCureWounds]{Cure Wounds}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMoonbeam00]{Moonbeam}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplStarryWisp]{Starry Wisp}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplConjureAni]{Conjure Animals}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.gira0SYUqrjTJfNy]{Fount of Moonlight}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMassCureWo]{Mass Cure Wounds}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "chat": ""
    },
